  "note": "Continuation of the Turkey Hill Middle School roster begun on page 110; the filename slug says 'unknown'. The col.1 heading 'Learning Center/Special Education' wraps across lines 1-2; line 2 is in entries because col.3 carries a person there. Lines 2-5 col.3 continue the Grade 6 team block headed on page 110, so their grade_or_dept is left empty rather than carried across a page break. Line 11 col.3 'Krista' wraps to line 12 'Diamantopoulos   Red'; the entry is filed on line 11 and line 12 counts as a heading because it also carries 'Paraprofessionals'. Line 9 col.2 is printed 'Occupational Therapist Dawn Grebinar' - the col.1 role cell and the col.3 name cell run together - and is split accordingly. Line 14 col.2 is printed '• Pa', an OCR fragment of a Para role, and role_raw keeps it as printed. In the Grade 7 block the second column is headed 'Team' and holds a team colour, not a job title."
